{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"mastermind.module-requirements","moduleId":"release-inventory","version":"1.2.0","requirements":["Expose exactly release-inventory.diff(before, after); keep the stable module identity release-inventory across compatible revisions.","Accept at most 2000 records per inventory. Each record supplies path and a 64-character lowercase hexadecimal SHA256. Reject malformed or extra fields.","Treat paths as bounded canonical relative POSIX strings of 1 through 1024 characters, preserving original spelling. Accept route brackets, route groups, scoped-package names, Unicode and spaces. Reject leading slash, drive prefix, backslash, NUL, empty path components, dot and dot-dot components.","Reject duplicate and Unicode-casefold-equivalent paths within each inventory. This conservative Windows-oriented policy is not an exact emulation of all Windows filesystem normalization. Comparisons across inventories preserve case; a case-only rename is a removed path and an added path.","Return added and removed records with path and sha256; changed records with path, before and after hashes; unchangedCount as the number of shared paths with equal hashes. Sort each output list by its preserved path string.","Never read, hash, modify, delete, resolve or follow the supplied paths. A supplied SHA256 is an input claim, not proof that a real file currently has that content.","Reject invalid inputs with the explicit exception type/message covered by the independent negative test cases.","Reject non-NUL ASCII control characters U+0001 through U+001F and DEL U+007F anywhere in inventory paths with ValueError: Inventory path contains control characters. Preserve the existing NUL-path exception and all previously valid ordinary Unicode/spaces and metadata behavior.","Preserve all 18 existing independent acceptance cases, optional nonnegative integer bytes metadata, stable identity and output shape.","This operation prepares and recovers a source package and build plan only. Preserve the accepted inactive 1.2 revision and completed coding receipt. Do not replay coding, run a model, activate a candidate or change current permissions."],"contracts":[{"effectClass":"READ_ONLY","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"after":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bytes":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"maxLength":1024,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"sha256":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":64,"type":"string"}},"required":["path","sha256"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":2000,"type":"array"},"before":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bytes":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"maxLength":1024,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"sha256":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":64,"type":"string"}},"required":["path","sha256"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":2000,"type":"array"}},"required":["before","after"],"type":"object"},"name":"release-inventory.diff","outputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"added":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"maxLength":1024,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"sha256":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":64,"type":"string"}},"required":["path","sha256"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":2000,"type":"array"},"changed":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"after":{"type":"string"},"before":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"}},"required":["path","before","after"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":2000,"type":"array"},"removed":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"maxLength":1024,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"sha256":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":64,"type":"string"}},"required":["path","sha256"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":2000,"type":"array"},"unchangedCount":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["added","removed","changed","unchangedCount"],"type":"object"}}],"effects":{"childProcesses":false,"codingAgent":false,"databaseAccess":false,"effectClass":"READ_ONLY","filesystem":"staged-inputs-only","network":false},"tests":{"cases":[{"capability":"release-inventory.diff","expected":{"added":[],"changed":[],"removed":[],"unchangedCount":0},"id":"empty","input":{"after":[],"before":[]}},{"capability":"release-inventory.diff","expected":{"added":[{"path":"new.py","sha256":"dddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddd"}],"changed":[{"after":"eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee","before":"cccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc","path":"change.py"}],"removed":[{"path":"old.py","sha256":"bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb"}],"unchangedCount":1},"id":"classify-all","input":{"after":[{"path":"change.py","sha256":"eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee"},{"path":"new.py","sha256":"dddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddd"},{"path":"same.py","sha256":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"}],"before":[{"path":"same.py","sha256":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"},{"path":"old.py","sha256":"bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb"},{"path":"change.py","sha256":"cccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc"}]}},{"capability":"release-inventory.diff","expected":{"added":[{"path":"a.py","sha256":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"},{"path":"z.py","sha256":"bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb"}],"changed":[],"removed":[],"unchangedCount":0},"id":"stable-order","input":{"after":[{"path":"z.py","sha256":"bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb"},{"path":"a.py","sha256":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"}],"before":[]}},{"capability":"release-inventory.diff","expected":{"added":[],"changed":[],"removed":[],"unchangedCount":1},"id":"optional-size-metadata","input":{"after":[{"bytes":12,"path":"same.py","sha256":"aaaaaaaaaaaaa